 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Text translation
+
+Open `/devtools-times/translate` or choose **Translate** in the header. Select the source and target languages, enter up to 5,000 characters, and choose **Translate text**. You can swap languages, clear the input, try an example, or copy the result.
+
+This feature uses the browser's on-device `Translator` API. It requires a secure context (HTTPS or localhost) and a supported desktop browser and device. The first use of a language pair may download a language pack; download progress appears in the form. Unsupported browsers and language pairs show an availability message. Text is not sent to a remote translation service.
+
+Run the translation lifecycle tests with `node --test tests/translation.test.ts` (Node 22.18+).
+
